build/
*.bin
*.img
*.o
.claude/

# limine/ vendors the Limine bootloader's prebuilt binary release
# (limine-bios-cd.bin, limine-uefi-cd.bin, ...) - those matter, unlike
# every other *.bin/*.o this ignores, so un-ignore them; the local
# `make`-built limine/limine deploy tool (host-specific, regenerated by
# the Makefile's own rule) stays ignored via limine/.gitignore itself.
!/limine/*.bin
